Permit2ConfigLib::initializeTokenIn
├── given single entry is provided
│   └── it should add the token to tokenInSet for the chainId
├── given multiple entries on same chain are provided
│   └── it should add all tokens to the chainId set
├── given entries are on different chains
│   └── it should store entries in separate chainId mappings
├── given there is remaining calldata
│   └── it should return the remaining bytes
├── given count is zero
│   └── it should return all calldata as remaining without modifying storage
└── given duplicate token on same chain
    └── it should deduplicate via EnumerableSet